    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey... i don't really know how to start this. it's been three weeks since i told my parents i'm gay and they basically told me to get out. i've been staying at my friend maya's place but i just feel so lost. like i feel erased. they made me and now it's like i don't exist to them anymore. i don't think i can exist in a world where the people who made me don't want me",
